<title>NEW ZEALAND: ASB Bank cuts NZ variable mortgage rate to 8.9 pct.</title>
<headline>ASB Bank cuts NZ variable mortgage rate to 8.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>ASB Bank said on Thursday it had reduced its New Zealand variable home lending rate to 8.9 percent from 9.4 percent, effective immediately for new customers and from July 14 for existing customers.</p>
<p>ASB said the cut was to celebrate its 150th birthday.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
